{"id":"dc4c434d18598483","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-countable-choice.md","title":"Countable Choice","display":"thm-countable-choice — Countable Choice","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-countable-choice","aliases":["58-thm-countable-choice","Countable Choice","AC_ω"],"display":"thm-countable-choice — Countable Choice","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-countable-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-countable-choice</span><span>Countable Choice</span><span>AC_ω</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-countable-choice — Countable Choice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,A,f\">\\(X,R,A,f\\)</span>（集合、关系、可数族与选择序列参数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\\)</span>（可数集合族的集合编码）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span>（不含选择公理的背景理论）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\quad\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\forall X\\;\\forall R\\;\n\\bigl(X\\ne\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq X^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;(xRy)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists g\\in X^\\omega\\;\n(g(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(g(n)R g(n+1)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\forall A\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(A(n)\\ne\\varnothing)\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\quad\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\forall X\\;\\forall R\\;\n\\bigl(X\\ne\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq X^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;(xRy)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists g\\in X^\\omega\\;\n(g(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(g(n)R g(n+1)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\forall A\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(A(n)\\ne\\varnothing)\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>前件是 DC 的逐始点形式，后件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}\\)</span> 的展开式；直接展开避免与下游 DC 定理形成循环依赖。</li>\n<li>可数族及选择序列均为显式集合函数，不把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 当作函数余域。</li>\n<li>在 ZF 上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}\\)</span>；逆向蕴含一般不可证。</li>\n<li>因而该定理只陈述从依赖选择到可数选择的直接推论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,A,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\quad\n&\\Bigl[\\forall X\\;\\forall R\\;\n\\bigl(X\\ne\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq X^2\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;(xRy)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\exists g\\in X^\\omega\\;\n(g(0)=x_0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(g(n)R g(n+1)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\to\n\\forall A\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(A))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(A(n)\\ne\\varnothing)\\to\n\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(A))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(f(n)\\in A(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{DC}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{AC}_{\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1636,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-countable-choice.md|58-thm-countable-choice]]（batch06）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]